Add the PULP-2346 A/B experiment for the content app's read-only content queries (the ``index.html`` probe, the directory listing and the exact file lookup). Variant B checks repository membership per matching row instead of walking the whole repository version's content and skips the probe for file paths. Off by default; enable with ``PULP_CONTENT_QUERY_AB_ENABLED`` and set the share with ``PULP_CONTENT_QUERY_AB_PROBABILITY``. The queries rely on the ``core_ca_relpath_pattern_idx`` index added by migration 0024.
